{"subject":"math2","year":2022,"count":22,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math2-2022-1","num":1,"desc":"无穷小比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["①若 $\\alpha(x)\\sim\\beta(x)$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\beta(x)}=1$。因此 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha^{2}(x)}{\\beta^{2}(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\beta(x)}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\beta(x)}=1\\cdot 1=1$，①正确。","②错，反例 $\\alpha(x)=x,\\beta(x)=-x$；","③若 $\\alpha(x)\\sim\\beta(x)$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\beta(x)}=1$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)-\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\alpha(x)}-\\dfrac{\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=1-1=0$，因此 $\\alpha(x)-\\beta(x)=o(\\alpha(x))$，③正确。","④若 $\\alpha(x)-\\beta(x)=o(\\alpha(x))$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)-\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=0$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\alpha(x)}{\\alpha(x)}-\\dfrac{\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=1-\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=0$，则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\beta(x)}{\\alpha(x)}=1$，即 $\\alpha(x)\\sim\\beta(x)$，④正确。","因此真命题有①③④，选（C）"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-2","num":2,"desc":"二重积分交换积分次序","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{2}\\mathrm{d}y\\int_{y}^{2}\\dfrac{y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{3}}}\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{0}^{2}\\mathrm{d}x\\int_{0}^{x}\\dfrac{y}{\\sqrt{1+x^{3}}}\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{2}\\dfrac{x^{2}}{2\\sqrt{1+x^{3}}}\\mathrm{d}x$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{2}\\dfrac{1}{6\\sqrt{1+x^{3}}}\\mathrm{d}(1+x^{3})\\ =\\dfrac{1}{3}\\sqrt{1+x^{3}}\\Big|_{0}^{2}=\\dfrac{2}{3}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-3","num":3,"desc":"导数局部保号性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$f(x)$ 在 $x=x_{0}$ 处二阶可导，则 $f(x)$ 在 $x=x_{0}$ 处一阶连续可导，若 $f'(x_{0})>0$，则在 $x=x_{0}$ 的邻域内 $f'(x)$ 均大于 0（局部保号性），因此 $f(x)$ 在此邻域内单调增。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-4","num":4,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$F(x,y)=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x-y}(x-y-t)f(t)\\mathrm{d}t=x\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t-y\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t-\\int_{0}^{x-y}tf(t)\\mathrm{d}t$","所以 $\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial x}=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t+xf(x-y)-yf(x-y)-(x-y)f(x-y)=\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t$","$\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial y}=-xf(x-y)-\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t+yf(x-y)+(x-y)f(x-y)=-\\int_{0}^{x-y}f(t)\\mathrm{d}t$","即 $\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial x}=-\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial y}$","$\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}F}{\\partial x^{2}}=f(x-y),\\ \\dfrac{\\partial^{2}F}{\\partial y^{2}}=f(x-y),\\ \\therefore\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}F}{\\partial x^{2}}=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}F}{\\partial y^{2}}$","综上，正确选项为（C）"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-5","num":5,"desc":"反常积分敛散性判别","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】先考虑 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$，","若 $p<1$，因为 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}}{\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\frac{1+p}{2}}}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}\\left(x^{\\frac{1-p}{2}}\\cdot\\ln x\\right)=0$，而 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\frac{1+p}{2}}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 收敛，故 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 也收敛；","若 $p\\geq 1$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}}{\\dfrac{1}{x}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p-1}}=\\infty$，且 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{1}{x}\\mathrm{d}x$ 发散，故 $\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 也发散。","再考虑 $\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 1^{-}}\\dfrac{\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}}{\\dfrac{1}{(1-x)^{-p}}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 1^{-}}\\dfrac{x-1}{(1-x)^{1-p}}=-1\\neq 0$，","故 $\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^{p}(1-x)^{1-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 与 $\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{1}{2}}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{(1-x)^{-p}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 同敛散，故 $-p<1$，即 $p>-1$，选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-6","num":6,"desc":"数列极限存在性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】取 $x_{n}=(-1)^{n}\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$，则（A）、（B）、（C）均错，且（D）的“$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}x_{n}$ 不一定存在”是正确的；（D）的“$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\cos x_{n}$ 存在”的原因：当 $-\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\leq x_{n}\\leq\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ 时，$0\\leq\\cos x_{n}\\leq 1$，而 $\\sin x$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上单调，故 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\cos x_{n}$ 存在。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-7","num":7,"desc":"定积分大小比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】比较 $I_{1},I_{2}$，令 $f(x)=\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\ln(1+x),x\\in(0,1)$，则","$f'(x)=\\dfrac{1}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{1+x}=\\dfrac{x-1}{2(1+x)}<0,x\\in(0,1)$","又 $f(0)=0$，所以 $f(x)<f(0)=0$，$I_{1}<I_{2}$；再比较 $I_{2},I_{3}$，","令 $g(x)=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{1+\\cos x}-\\dfrac{2x}{1+\\sin x}=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)(1+\\sin x)-2x(1+\\cos x)}{(1+\\cos x)(1+\\sin x)}$，","$h(x)=\\ln(1+x)(1+\\sin x)-2x(1+\\cos x)=\\ln(1+x)-x+\\sin x\\cdot\\ln(1+x)-x-2x\\cos x,x\\in(0,1)$","其中 $\\ln(1+x)-x<0$，$\\sin x\\cdot\\ln(1+x)-x<0$，$-2x\\cos x<0$，则 $I_{2}<I_{3}$，故选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-8","num":8,"desc":"矩阵特征值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\boldsymbol{A}$ 有 3 个不同特征值，故 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 一定可以对角化 $\\Leftrightarrow$ 存在可逆矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{P}$，使得 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{P}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-9","num":9,"desc":"线性方程组解的判定","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$|\\boldsymbol{A}|=(b-1)(b-a)(a-1)$。当 $b\\neq 1$ 且 $a\\neq 1$ 且 $b\\neq a$ 时，$r(\\boldsymbol{A})=r\\big(\\boldsymbol{A}\\big|\\boldsymbol{b}\\big)=3$ 有唯一解；当 $b=1\\big(b\\neq 1\\big)$ 或 $a=1\\big(b\\neq 1\\big)$ 或 $a=b=1$ 时均有 $r(\\boldsymbol{A})<r\\big(\\boldsymbol{A}\\big|\\boldsymbol{b}\\big)$ 无解。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-10","num":10,"desc":"向量组等价","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","$\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)=\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda&1&1&1\\\\ 1&\\lambda&1&\\lambda\\\\ 1&1&\\lambda&\\lambda^{2}\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\lambda&\\lambda^{2}\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&1-\\lambda&\\lambda-\\lambda^{2}\\\\ 0&1-\\lambda&1-\\lambda^{2}&1-\\lambda^{3}\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&\\lambda&\\lambda^{2}\\\\ 0&\\lambda-1&1-\\lambda&\\lambda-\\lambda^{2}\\\\ 0&0&2-\\lambda-\\lambda^{2}&1+\\lambda-\\lambda^{2}-\\lambda^{3}\\end{pmatrix}$","已知 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}$ 等价，则 $r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}\\big)=r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)=r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)$","当 $\\lambda=-1$ 时，$r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}\\big)=3,r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)=2$ 与向量组等价矛盾，故 $\\lambda\\neq-1$","当 $\\lambda=-2$ 时，$r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}\\big)=2,r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)=3$ 与向量组等价矛盾，故 $\\lambda\\neq-2$","故排除（B）（D）；当 $\\lambda=2$，$r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}\\big)=r\\big(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4}\\big)=3$，故排除（A），于是该题选（C）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-11","num":11,"desc":"幂指函数极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\left(\\dfrac{1+\\mathrm{e}^{x}}{2}\\right)^{\\cot x}=\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\left(1+\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{x}-1}{2}\\right)^{\\cot x}=\\mathrm{e}^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{\\cos x(\\mathrm{e}^{x}-1)}{2\\sin x}}=\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{1}{2}}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-12","num":12,"desc":"隐函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】同时对原等式两端求导：$2x+y+xy'+3y^{2}y'=0$；","再次求导：$2+2y'+xy''+6y(y')^{2}+3y^{2}y''=0$，","当 $x=1$ 时 $y=1$，$y'=-\\dfrac{3}{4}$，$y''(1)=-\\dfrac{31}{32}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-13","num":13,"desc":"有理函数积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{2x+3}{x^{2}-x+1}\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{2x-1}{x^{2}-x+1}\\mathrm{d}x+4\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}-x+1}\\mathrm{d}x$","$=\\ln\\left|x^{2}-x+1\\right|\\big|_{0}^{1}+4\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{1}{\\left(x-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{2}+\\dfrac{3}{4}}\\mathrm{d}x=\\dfrac{8}{\\sqrt{3}}\\arctan\\dfrac{2x-1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\big|_{0}^{1}=\\dfrac{8\\sqrt{3}\\pi}{9}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-14","num":14,"desc":"高阶常系数线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】微分方程对应特征方程为：$\\lambda^{3}-2\\lambda^{2}+5\\lambda=0$。可得特征值为 $\\lambda_{1}=0,\\lambda_{2,3}=1\\pm 2i$。","所以原方程的通解为：$y=C_{1}+\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\left(C_{2}\\sin 2x+C_{3}\\cos 2x\\right)$，$C_{1},C_{2},C_{3}$ 为任意常数。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-15","num":15,"desc":"极坐标下曲线面积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$S=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\sin^{2}3\\theta\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{3}\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\sin^{2}\\theta\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\dfrac{\\pi}{12}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-16","num":16,"desc":"初等变换与矩阵乘积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\\\ 0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ -1&1&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&-1\\\\ 1&-1&0\\\\ -1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，","则 $\\boldsymbol{A}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ -1&1&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-2&1&-1\\\\ 1&-1&0\\\\ -1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\\\ 0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&-1\\\\ -1&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$","故 $\\mathrm{tr}(\\boldsymbol{A}^{-1})=-1$"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-17","num":17,"desc":"导数定义","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$f(x)$ 在 $x=1$ 处可导，则 $f(x)$ 在 $x=1$ 处连续，","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\left[f\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{x^{2}}\\right)-3f\\left(1+\\sin^{2}x\\right)\\right]=-2f(1)$","又因为 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{x^{2}}\\right)-3f\\left(1+\\sin^{2}x\\right)}{x^{2}}\\cdot x^{2}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{x^{2}}\\right)-3f\\left(1+\\sin^{2}x\\right)}{x^{2}}\\cdot\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}x^{2}=0$，所以 $f(1)=0$。","原式 $=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{x^{2}}\\right)-f(1)}{x^{2}}-3\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f\\left(1+\\sin^{2}x\\right)-f(1)}{x^{2}}=-2f'(1)=2$","所以 $f'(1)=-1$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-18","num":18,"desc":"一阶线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】由 $y'-\\dfrac{2}{x}y=\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2x}$，","$y(x)=\\mathrm{e}^{\\int\\frac{2}{x}\\mathrm{d}x}\\left[\\int\\left(\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}-\\dfrac{1}{2x}\\right)\\mathrm{e}^{-\\int\\frac{2}{x}\\mathrm{d}x}\\mathrm{d}x+C\\right]=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln x+Cx^{2}$","又因为 $y(1)=\\dfrac{1}{4}$，$\\therefore C=\\dfrac{1}{4}$；即 $y(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln x+\\dfrac{1}{4}x^{2}$，","所以 $y'(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{2x}+\\dfrac{1}{2}x$ 从而弧长 $L=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{\\mathrm{e}}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}x+\\dfrac{1}{2x}\\right)\\mathrm{d}x=\\left.\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}x^{2}+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln|x|\\right)\\right|_{1}^{\\mathrm{e}}=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\mathrm{e}^{2}+\\dfrac{1}{4}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-19","num":19,"desc":"二重积分极坐标计算","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $D_{1}=\\left\\{(r,\\theta)\\middle|0\\leq r\\leq 2,0\\leq\\theta\\leq\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right\\}$，","$D_{2}=\\left\\{(r,\\theta)\\middle|0\\leq r\\leq\\dfrac{2}{\\sin\\theta-\\cos\\theta},\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\leq\\theta\\leq\\pi\\right\\}$，","$I=\\displaystyle\\iint_{D_{1}}\\dfrac{(x-y)^{2}}{x^{2}+y^{2}}dxdy+\\iint_{D_{2}}\\dfrac{(x-y)^{2}}{x^{2}+y^{2}}dxdy$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{2}\\left(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta\\right)^{2}rdr+\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{\\frac{2}{\\sin\\theta-\\cos\\theta}}\\left(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta\\right)^{2}rdr$","$=2\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\left(1-2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\right)d\\theta+\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}2d\\theta=2\\pi-2$"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-20","num":20,"desc":"多元复合函数求偏导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) $\\dfrac{\\partial g(x,y)}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y-x)}{\\partial x}$，令 $u=x,v=y-x$，","$\\dfrac{\\partial f(x,y-x)}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{\\partial f(u,v)}{\\partial u}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}+\\dfrac{\\partial f(u,v)}{\\partial v}\\cdot\\dfrac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{\\partial f(u,v)}{\\partial u}-\\dfrac{\\partial f(u,v)}{\\partial v}=2(u-v)\\cdot\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}=2(2x-y)\\cdot\\mathrm{e}^{-y}$","(II) $g(x,y)=2(x^{2}-xy)\\mathrm{e}^{-y}+C(y)$，又 $f(x,0)=g(x,x)=C(x)=x^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{-x}$，","所以 $C(x)=x^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{-x},g(x,y)=2(x^{2}-xy)\\mathrm{e}^{-y}+y^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{-y}=[2x^{2}-2xy+y^{2}]\\mathrm{e}^{-y}$，","令 $\\begin{cases}x=u\\\\ y-x=v\\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases}x=u\\\\ y=u+v\\end{cases}$ 得","$f(u,v)=-2uv\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}+(u+v)^{2}\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}=(u^{2}+v^{2})\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}$","令 $\\begin{cases}f'_{u}=[2u-(u^{2}+v^{2})]\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}=0\\\\ f'_{v}=[2v-(u^{2}+v^{2})]\\mathrm{e}^{-(u+v)}=0\\end{cases}$ 得 $\\begin{cases}u=0\\\\ v=0\\end{cases}$ 或 $\\begin{cases}u=1\\\\ v=1\\end{cases}$","$A=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial u^{2}}\\big|_{(0,0)}=2,B=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial u\\partial v}\\big|_{(0,0)}=0,C=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial v^{2}}\\big|_{(0,0)}=2,\\ AC-B^{2}>0,A>0$，得 $f(u,v)\\big|_{(0,0)}=0$ 为极小值；","$A=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial u^{2}}\\big|_{(1,1)}=0,B=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial u\\partial v}\\big|_{(1,1)}=-2\\mathrm{e}^{-2},C=\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}f}{\\partial v^{2}}\\big|_{(1,1)}=0,\\ AC-B^{2}<0$，得在 $(1,1)$ 处不是极值。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-21","num":21,"desc":"泰勒公式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$f(x)=f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)+f'\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)+\\dfrac{1}{2}f''(\\xi)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)^{2}$，$\\xi$ 介于 $x$ 与 $\\dfrac{a+b}{2}$ 之间。","$\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{a}^{b}\\left[f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)+f'\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)+\\dfrac{1}{2}f''(\\xi)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)^{2}\\right]\\mathrm{d}x$","$=f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)(b-a)+\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{2}f''(\\xi)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)^{2}\\right]\\mathrm{d}x$","必要性：若 $f''(x)\\geq 0$，则 $f''(\\xi)\\geq 0$，有 $\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x}{(b-a)}\\geq f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)$。","充分性：若存在 $x_{0}$ 使得 $f''(x_{0})<0$，因为 $f(x)$ 有二阶连续导数，故存在 $\\delta>0$ 使得 $f''(x)$ 在 $\\big[x_{0}-\\delta,x_{0}+\\delta\\big]$ 内恒小于零，记 $a=x_{0}-\\delta,b=x_{0}+\\delta$，","此时 $\\displaystyle\\int_{a}^{b}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)(b-a)+\\int_{a}^{b}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{2}f''(\\xi)\\big(x-\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)^{2}\\right]\\mathrm{d}x<f\\big(\\dfrac{a+b}{2}\\big)(b-a)$，矛盾！","故 $f''(x)\\geq 0$。综上，充分性必要性均得证。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2022-22","num":22,"desc":"二次型正交变换","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2022数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) $f\\left(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3}\\right)=3x_{1}^{2}+4x_{2}^{2}+3x_{3}^{2}+2x_{1}x_{3}$，","二次型矩阵为 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}3&0&1\\\\ 0&4&0\\\\ 1&0&3\\end{pmatrix}$，则特征方程为","$|\\lambda\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-3&0&-1\\\\ 0&\\lambda-4&0\\\\ -1&0&\\lambda-3\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda-4)^{2}(\\lambda-2)$","得特征值 $\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=4,\\lambda_{3}=2$。","当 $\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=4$ 时，$(4\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A})x=0$ 得 $\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{1}=(0,1,0)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{2}=(1,0,1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$","当 $\\lambda_{3}=2$ 时，$(2\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A})x=0$ 得 $\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{3}=(1,0,-1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$。","将 $\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{1}=(0,1,0)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{2}=(1,0,1)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\boldsymbol{\\xi}_{3}=(1,0,-1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 正交单位化得","$\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{1}=(0,1,0)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(1,0,1)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\boldsymbol{\\eta}_{3}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(1,0,-1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$ 可得 $\\boldsymbol{Q}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\\\ 1&0&0\\\\ 0&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{pmatrix}$，即","$\\begin{cases}x_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}y_{2}+\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}y_{3}\\\\ x_{2}=y_{2}\\\\ x_{3}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}y_{2}-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}y_{3}\\end{cases}$","$f(\\boldsymbol{x})=4y_{1}^{2}+4y_{2}^{2}+2y_{3}^{2}$","(II) 由（1）知 $f\\left(\\boldsymbol{x}\\right)=4y_{1}^{2}+4y_{2}^{2}+2y_{3}^{2}$，$\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{Q}\\boldsymbol{y}$，故 $\\boldsymbol{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{x}=\\boldsymbol{y}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{Q}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{Q}\\boldsymbol{y}=\\boldsymbol{y}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{y}$","故 $\\dfrac{f(\\boldsymbol{x})}{\\boldsymbol{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{x}}=\\dfrac{g(\\boldsymbol{y})}{\\boldsymbol{y}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{y}}=\\dfrac{4y_{1}^{2}+4y_{2}^{2}+2y_{3}^{2}}{y_{1}^{2}+y_{2}^{2}+y_{3}^{2}}=2+\\dfrac{2y_{1}^{2}+2y_{2}^{2}}{y_{1}^{2}+y_{2}^{2}+y_{3}^{2}}\\geq 2$","当 $y_{1}=y_{2}=0,y_{3}\\neq 0$ 时，可取到最小值 2。","所以存在非零向量 $\\boldsymbol{y}$，即存在非零向量 $\\boldsymbol{x}$，使得 $\\dfrac{f(\\boldsymbol{x})}{\\boldsymbol{x}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{x}}$ 取到最小值 2。得证。"]}]}]}